% Utterances consisting of just a word or phrase are interpreted as an
% argument or modifier of an implied eventuality represented by the 'unknown'
% relation.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Fragments/):
%   h0:unknown[ARG0 e1, ARG x2]
%   _[ARG0 x2]

pattern { U [pred="unknown"] }
